    "property_title": "Lots for Sale in Upper Central- Mountain Meadows",
    "short_description": "",
    "description": "Lots for Sale in Upper Central, CDO!\r\n\r\nLooking for a peaceful yet central location to build your dream home? We have 4 prime lots available in a private cul-de-sac within Mountain Meadows, now part of Upper Central by Megaworld.\r\n\r\nThis area is perfect for families or anyone looking for privacy while still being in the heart of the city. Located in an elevated, overlooking spot, it offers a cool breeze and quiet surroundings—just minutes away from:\r\n\r\nLimketkai Mall, SM CDO Premier, Centrio Mall\r\nLapasan Highway\r\nMaria Reyna Hospital & CUMC\r\nSchools, markets, and other essentials\r\n\r\nAddress: Block 3 Lots 28–31, Upper Central 2-C, Downtown Cagayan de Oro\r\n\r\nLot Sizes:\r\n • Lot 28 – 452 sqm\r\n • Lot 29 – 331 sqm\r\n • Lot 30 – 422 sqm\r\n • Lot 31 – 455 sqm\r\n\r\nClean titles\r\n\r\nSelling Price: ₱15,000/sqm\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this rare opportunity to own land in one of the most strategic and peaceful locations in CDO.\r\n\r\nMessage me for details or to schedule a viewing!\r\n",
